WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.710 --> 00:00:05.633
The only way to be truly satisfied

00:00:05.633 --> 00:00:07.844
Is to do what you believe is great work.

00:00:08.044 --> 00:00:09.956
And the only way to do great work

00:00:09.966 --> 00:00:12.286
is to love what you do.

00:00:12.286 --> 00:00:14.456
If you haven't found it yet, keep looking

00:00:14.562 --> 00:00:17.145
and don't settle. As with

00:00:17.145 --> 00:00:18.647
all matters of the heart,

00:00:18.647 --> 00:00:21.037
you'll know when you find it.

00:00:21.037 --> 00:00:22.654
Sometimes life is gonna hit you

00:00:22.654 --> 00:00:24.023
in the head with a brick.

00:00:24.023 --> 00:00:26.109
Don't lose faith

00:00:26.109 --> 00:00:27.186
I'm convinced that the only thing

00:00:27.186 --> 00:00:28.704
that kept me going is that

00:00:28.704 --> 00:00:29.984
I loved what I did

00:00:29.984 --> 00:00:32.436
You've got to find what you love

00:00:32.436 --> 00:00:34.326
So you have to trust that the dots

00:00:34.326 --> 00:00:36.461
will somehow connect in your future

00:00:36.461 --> 00:00:38.275
You have to trust in something,

00:00:38.275 --> 00:00:41.596
your gut, destiny, life, karma, Whatever

00:00:41.596 --> 00:00:43.003
because believeing that the dots

00:00:43.003 --> 00:00:45.042
will connect down the road

00:00:45.042 --> 00:00:46.113
will give you the confidence

00:00:46.113 --> 00:00:47.565
to follow your heart

00:00:47.565 --> 00:00:49.133
even when it leads you off

00:00:49.133 --> 00:00:51.043
the well worn path

00:00:51.043 --> 00:00:53.359
and that will make all the difference.

00:00:53.359 --> 00:00:55.578
Your time is limited, so

00:00:55.578 --> 00:00:58.937
don't waste it living someone else's life.

00:00:58.937 --> 00:01:01.341
Don't be trapped by dogma

00:01:01.341 --> 00:01:02.459
which is living with the results of

00:01:02.459 --> 00:01:03.936
other people's thinking

00:01:03.936 --> 00:01:05.905
Don't let the noise of others

00:01:05.905 --> 00:01:08.563
opinions drown out your own inner voice

00:01:08.563 --> 00:01:10.626
And most important have the courage

00:01:10.626 --> 00:01:12.853
to follow your heart and intuition

00:01:12.853 --> 00:01:15.111
They somehow already know what you truly

00:01:15.111 --> 00:01:17.159
want to become. Everything else

00:01:17.159 --> 00:01:21.159
is secondary.

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:27.000
